  "howto": {
    "what": "它把 OpenCode 接入为 NanoClaw 的 agent 提供方:容器里的 agent 改用 OpenRouter、DeepSeek 等模型运行,不走 Anthropic Agent SDK。安装会拷入 provider 文件、装依赖并重建镜像。",
    "when": "当你要求让某个 agent 组改用 OpenRouter、OpenAI、DeepSeek 等模型,或运行 `ncl groups config update --provider opencode` 时接管。",
    "say": [
      {
        "text": "把这个 agent 组的 provider 切成 opencode,然后重启它",
        "note": "会写 container_configs 并重启该组"
      },
      {
        "text": "给 DeepSeek 配好 OpenCode 的 .env,再帮我注册密钥",
        "note": "写入 OPENCODE_PROVIDER 等变量并注册密钥"
      },
      {
        "text": "把 OpenCode provider 文件同步到已有的组 overlay 里",
        "note": "逐个复制到 v2-sessions 的 overlay"
      }
    ],
    "source": "llm",
    "content_hash": "sha256:e84d0f92dec5e49491c2b1fdaa347b59e67ef190fd627056273f27291b3b1abf",
    "model": "deepseek-v4-flash",
    "generated_at": "2026-09-28T09:22:10.406Z",
    "lint_pass": true,
    "what_en": "Installs OpenCode as NanoClaw's agent provider, so container agents run OpenRouter, OpenAI or DeepSeek models instead of the Anthropic Agent SDK. It copies provider files, adds dependencies and rebuilds the image.",
    "when_en": "Triggers when you want a group to use OpenRouter, OpenAI, DeepSeek or similar models, or run `ncl groups config update --provider opencode`.",
    "say_en": [
      {
        "text": "Switch this agent group's provider to opencode and restart it",
        "note": "Writes container_configs and restarts the group"
      },
      {
        "text": "Set up OpenCode's .env for DeepSeek and register the key",
        "note": "Sets OPENCODE_PROVIDER, MODEL and ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL"
      },
      {
        "text": "Copy the OpenCode provider files into existing group overlays",
        "note": "Copies into each v2-sessions overlay"
      }
    ]
